  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"one third left parenthesis x plus 6 right parenthesis minus one half left parenthesis x plus 6 right parenthesis equals negative 8\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is the solution to the given equation?</p>",
